    "main_argument_chains": [
      {
        "claim": "Entropy weights and TOPSIS score Shenzhen's reserve, countryside, suburb, and city at 0.357992, 1.859474, 2.114942, and 3.19662; of the three strategies, lowering the radiance cuts the score by about 6 percent against 2 and 3, and it is the indicator a ten percent shift moves most.",
